I'm sensitive to the fact that some folk might prefer the previous method of viewing Markdown, so this feature is configurable{a}. If you'd prefer the widget-based rendering instead, set this value:

=> https://rogallo.davep.dev/viewer/#markdown-rendering {a} is configurable

```json
"convert_markdown_to_gemtext": true
```

